  "template": "<div lang=\"es\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/coleccion/polimero-mundial/islas-salomon-2-dolares-2001/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Central Bank of Solomon Islands — 2 Dólares (2001)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/coleccion/polimero-mundial/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Catálogo de Billetes de Polímero Mundial</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Billetes de Polímero Mundial &middot; Islas Salomón &middot; 2001</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Central Bank of Solomon Islands</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Dos Dólares &middot; Jubileo de Plata del CBSI (1976&ndash;2001)</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">País</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Islas Salomón</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Entidad Emisora</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Central Bank of Solomon Islands (CBSI)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Dos Dólares (SI$2) &mdash; billete conmemorativo</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero &mdash; sustrato Guardian&reg; &mdash; el primer billete de polímero emitido en Islas Salomón<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Note Printing Australia (NPA)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Año de Emisión</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">2001, por el 25.&ordm; aniversario (Jubileo de Plata) del Central Bank of Solomon Islands (1976&ndash;2001)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">3</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmas</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Rick Houenipwela (Gobernador) &middot; Janardana Kumar (Secretario de Finanzas)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">130 &times; 65 mm</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Rareza</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Emisión conmemorativa de tirada limitada; pieza histórica muy buscada por coleccionistas</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-23, Standard Catalog of World Paper Money<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">4</sup></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n<button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"solomon-islands-2-dollars-2001-polimero\"\n            aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/solomon-islands-cbsi-2-dollars-2001-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/solomon-islands-cbsi-2-dollars-2001-polimero.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Billete conmemorativo de 2 dólares de polímero del Central Bank of Solomon Islands, anverso arriba con el escudo de armas nacional, reverso abajo con pescadores tradicionales usando red y lanzas\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"580\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Billete ampliado\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"solomon-islands-2-dollars-2001-polimero\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Cerrar\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Alejar\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  aria-label=\"Acercar\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/solomon-islands-cbsi-2-dollars-2001-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"/uploads/solomon-islands-cbsi-2-dollars-2001-polimero.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Billete conmemorativo de 2 dólares de polímero del Central Bank of Solomon Islands, vista ampliada\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Contexto Histórico y de Emisión</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">El primer polímero salomonense:</strong> el Central Bank of Solomon Islands emitió este billete de 2 dólares en 2001 para conmemorar sus 25 años de existencia como autoridad bancaria independiente &mdash;el primer billete de polímero puesto en circulación por el país.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1,3</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Impreso por Note Printing Australia:</strong> pionero mundial del sustrato de polímero, NPA imprimió este billete sobre tecnología Guardian&reg;, con ventana de seguridad transparente y marca de agua de sombra.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave Visibles en el Billete</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> escudo de armas nacional de las Islas Salomón, flanqueado por un cocodrilo y un tiburón; debajo, un &ldquo;apira&rdquo; (cuenco ceremonial de madera tradicional) entre dos peces estilizados. El texto conmemorativo &ldquo;COMMEMORATING CBSI SILVER JUBILEE&rdquo; recorre el campo del diseño.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> escena histórica de pescadores locales usando una red comunitaria tradicional y lanzas, con un motivo vertical abstracto de mascarón de proa de canoa a la izquierda.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">5</sup></span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana con viñeta:</strong> ventana transparente semiovalada en la parte superior izquierda del anverso, con una imagen de sombra blanca de un águila marina en vuelo.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Microimpresión de patrón guilloché:</strong> bordes de seguridad con líneas geométricas ultrafinas diseñadas para frustrar la reproducción digital.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Numeración fluorescente:</strong> los números de serie alfanuméricos verticales del lado derecho se iluminan en color rojo anaranjado bajo luz ultravioleta.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Imagen de sombra:</strong> diseño opacificado integrado en el sustrato que revela las letras &ldquo;CBSI&rdquo; como un patrón electrotipo al trasluz.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> tonos verde oliva, azul y marrón en el subimpreso multicolor.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <div style=\"width:100%; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notas</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. Roberts World Money. &ldquo;Solomon Islands 2 Dollars, 2001, Commemorative, CBSI Silver Jubilee, P23.&rdquo; <em>robertsworldmoney.com</em>: &ldquo;This is the first polymer note issued by the Solomon Islands.&rdquo;</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">2. Roberts World Money, íd.: &ldquo;Printer: Note Printing Australia.&rdquo;</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">3. Banknote World. &ldquo;Solomon Islands 2 Dollars Banknote, 2001, P-23.&rdquo; <em>banknoteworld.com</em>: &ldquo;issued by the Central Bank of Solomon Islands in 2001 to commemorate the bank&rsquo;s 25th anniversary.&rdquo;</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">4. Harisnumis. &ldquo;SOLOMON ISLANDS 2 Dollars ND(2001), Comm. P23 UNC.&rdquo; <em>harisnumis.com</em>: &ldquo;Catalog no.: P# 23.&rdquo;</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">5. Banknote World, íd.: &ldquo;The note&rsquo;s reverse depicts shell rings, fish, a bird, and men spearfishing.&rdquo;</p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
